Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 18:41:13 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 058/128] feat: queue text behind uploading media

Hold text sends behind earlier uploading media, allow older replies through, and release held sends on double enter.

Constraint: Scheduled messages and explicit retries bypass the hold

Rejected: Queue persisted across process death | in-memory delayed upload state is not durable

Confidence: medium

Scope-risk: moderate

Not-tested: Manual multi-device upload and double-enter behavior
